{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12201210","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12201210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1220121001:0":{"text":"주변을 돌아보았지만 바닷가에는 아무도 없었다. 멀리서 들려오는 파도 소리만이 허공을 맴돈다.","source_cn":"环视四周，只有遥远的海浪声，周围空无一人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06F78747A218DF4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220121002:1":{"text":"조, 조나단이 없어졌어요?! 아까까지만 해도 이곳에 있었는데!","source_cn":"乔、乔纳森先生不见了？！他刚刚明明还在这里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x090EE6294490034A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220121003:1":{"text":"우리가 떠날 때 세실리아를 데려온다고 했는데... 왜 사라진 걸까요? 분명 세실리아를 만나고 싶었을 텐데요?","source_cn":"我们离开时说过会带塞西莉亚来见他……为什么他离开了？他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E18C5531891CEB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220121004:1":{"text":"세실리아에게 지금의 모습을 보여주기 싫었던 것 아닐까요...","source_cn":"可能是，不想让塞西莉亚见到他现在的样子吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E8206E42A3ED4A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220121005:1":{"text":"... 조나단은 정말 바보예요.","source_cn":"……真是个彻头彻尾的大笨蛋。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44BE6D3DA10CB026","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220121006:1":{"text":"조나단은 빛나고 따뜻한 마음씨를 가지고 있어서 어떤 모습으로 변했든 저는 다 알아볼 수 있는데 말이죠.","source_cn":"他那颗明亮而温暖的心，不管变成什么样子，我都认得出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD766F314B7B0AA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1220121006":{"text":"조나단은 빛나고 따뜻한 마음씨를 가지고 있어서 어떤 모습으로 변했든 저는 다 알아볼 수 있는데 말이죠.","source_cn":"他那颗明亮而温暖的心，不管变成什么样子，我都认得出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD766F314B7B0AA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220121007:1":{"text":"서쪽 해변에 있는 나루터에 있을 것 같아요.","source_cn":"我想，可能在西边海滩的渡口吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7BE1CFBD54889009","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"서쪽 해변에 있는 나루터에 있을 것 같아요.","female":"서쪽 해변에 있는 나루터에 있을 것 같아요.","variant_male_record_index":"132980","variant_female_record_index":"132981","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220121008:1":{"text":"고민이 있으면 꼭 그곳에서 바람을 쐬었어요. 그래서 조나단을 찾을 때면 항상 그곳에 갔었죠.","source_cn":"他遇到不顺心的事，总会躲在渡口吹风。每次我都会去那里找他。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11F1A827609C4D24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220121009:1":{"text":"그럴 때마다 조나단은 나루터를 가리키면서 돈을 많이 모으면 그곳에서 출항해 멀리 떠날 거라고 이야기했어요.","source_cn":"每一次，他都指着渡口说，等将来攒够钱，就从那里启航，前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79B465218896C2A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"조나단이 어디로 갔을까?","source_cn":"乔纳森可能去哪里？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x50BA27713E31B21E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"조나단이 어디로 갔을까?","female":"조나단이 어디로 갔을까?","variant_male_record_index":"66184","variant_female_record_index":"66185","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"찾을 수 있겠어?","source_cn":"你能找到他吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3067A04E48EAC86C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"찾을 수 있겠어?","female":"찾을 수 있겠어?","variant_male_record_index":"66186","variant_female_record_index":"66187","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塞西莉亚":{"text":"세실리아","source":"塞西莉亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":4}}